# Line endings, settled once.
#
# Every text file is stored AND checked out as LF, on every platform. Without this, Windows'
# default core.autocrlf=true made git print "LF will be replaced by CRLF" for nearly every file in
# nearly every commit — hundreds of warnings drowning out anything real. All tooling in this repo
# (tsc, vite, maven, electron-builder) is indifferent to endings; nothing here needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.pdf binary
